      "id": "math-box-t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1380,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "对每个 chunk t:\n\nO_t = scale · exp(g_t) ⊙ Q_t · H_t\n      + scale · ( M ⊙ exp(g_i - g_j) ⊙ Q_t · K_t^T ) · V_t\n\nscale = 1/√K\nM    = 下三角因果掩码 (i ≥ j)\ng_i, g_j: chunk 内 log-gate 累计值 (chunk_local_cumsum)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": "math-box",
      "originalText": "对每个 chunk t:\n\nO_t = scale · exp(g_t) ⊙ Q_t · H_t\n      + scale · ( M ⊙ exp(g_i - g_j) ⊙ Q_t · K_t^T ) · V_t\n\nscale = 1/√K\nM    = 下三角因果掩码 (i ≥ j)\ng_i, g_j: chunk 内 log-gate 累计值 (chunk_local_cumsum)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
