      "id": "shape-box-t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1380,
      "y": 370,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "q : [B, T, Hg, K]   stride(t)=Hg*K\nk : [B, T, Hg, K]   stride(t)=Hg*K\nv : [B, T, H , V]   stride(t)=H*V\no : [B, T, H , V]   stride(t)=H*V\nh : [B, NT, H, K, V]\n    每 chunk 起点的 SSM 状态\ng : [B, T, H] -> transpose -> [B, H, T]\n    g_ptr = g + bos + i_h * T_max\n\nGQA 映射:\n  group_size = H // Hg\n  kv_head    = i_h // group_size\n\nTile: BT=64  BK=128  BV=128",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": "shape-box",
      "originalText": "q : [B, T, Hg, K]   stride(t)=Hg*K\nk : [B, T, Hg, K]   stride(t)=Hg*K\nv : [B, T, H , V]   stride(t)=H*V\no : [B, T, H , V]   stride(t)=H*V\nh : [B, NT, H, K, V]\n    每 chunk 起点的 SSM 状态\ng : [B, T, H] -> transpose -> [B, H, T]\n    g_ptr = g + bos + i_h * T_max\n\nGQA 映射:\n  group_size = H // Hg\n  kv_head    = i_h // group_size\n\nTile: BT=64  BK=128  BV=128",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
